# External code exclusion evidence

The active GOV-0/R0 payload contains governance documents, JSON Schemas, and deterministic governance verification tools only. Product implementation remains absent and unauthorized.

A read-only comparison examined 22 files from the supplied external bootstrap archive against all 56 blobs in the predecessor sealed repository. Exact SHA-256 intersection count was zero. The predecessor repository also contained none of the archive's product or template path families for packages, database schema, playbooks, agents, skills, or squads.

The external archive has SHA-256 `5976297261dfba6299695ab615aa8b28d482d01f2d672a0092bd2f4df04cc9bf`. It is not included in this repository. Its license and publication rights are unproven, so no file from it may be imported under this proposal.

Future implementation must be clean-source. If a dependency or source file requires third-party attribution, work must stop for license review; attribution must never be removed merely to satisfy the identity-boundary check.
